Assignment Title: Exploring Medium Through Prompt Variation
Prompt A (painting): Create an artwork that uses oil paitn to emphasize the vibrant colors and texture of the landscape. Use a palette knife and techniques such as blending, glazing, and impasto to create movement and further emphasize texture. The composition should feature a landscape with a river reflecting the sunset painted in the sky accompanied by a family of ducks near the water.
Prompt B (serigraphy): Create a serigraphy (screenprint) print that emphasizes color contrast. Use screens, stencils, and a squeege to layer ink on top of each other.
